// ============================================================================
// DESIGN SYSTEM & 120 BPM GRID (1080x1920 @ 30fps, 450 frames: 0..449)
// 120 BPM @ 30fps = 15 frames per beat (f15, f30, f45, ..., f255, ..., f375)
// Safe zone: x120..960, y269..1248 | Badge exclusion: x96..474, y248..424
// ============================================================================
